# MT6351 PMIC keys — the "Esc" key and the silver button (issue #61).
#
# Built-in, not a module: these are the machine's only two hardware buttons and
# they should work at the console before any rootfs is mounted.
#
# The driver is POLLED. The MT6351's interrupt is EINT 262 (vendor mt6797.dts)
# and mainline pinctrl-mt6797 has no EINT support (blockers.md B-11), so the
# interrupt-driven mtk-pmic-keys cannot bind here. Same blocker, same workaround
# as the keyboard matrix (patches/v6.6/input/0001) and the lid.
CONFIG_KEYBOARD_MT6351=y
